  "title": "Meat Pie",
  "description": "This meat pie features beef, pork, and potato with herbs and warm spices for a super-comforting meal. Using store-bought pie dough makes it a snap.",
  "authors": [
    "Lauralane"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:32:51-04:00",
